&lt;h2&gt;About Capco&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a global business and technology consultancy specializing in the financial services and energy industries. We bring together industry knowledge, technology expertise, and an innovative mindset to support clients in complex transformation initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Capco, you will be part of a collaborative and entrepreneurial environment where you can work alongside experienced professionals, expand your expertise, and contribute to impactful projects across the financial services industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Cryptography &amp;amp; Key Management Security Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; with strong expertise in cryptographic technologies, PKI, Hardware Security Modules (HSMs), and secrets management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a specialist role for security professionals who enjoy combining &lt;strong&gt;hands-on operational responsibilities with security advisory and strategic project work&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Cryptography &amp;amp; Key Management Security Engineer, you will support complex and business-critical security environments within the financial services sector. You will contribute to the secure management of cryptographic keys, digital certificates, and application secrets while helping organizations strengthen their cryptographic capabilities and prepare for future security challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will collaborate with security specialists, architects, application teams, infrastructure experts, and other stakeholders to translate security and regulatory requirements into secure, scalable, and operationally feasible solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
